-- הסכם קיבוצי ליישום רפורמת "אופק חדש" במערכת החינוך (25.12.2008), המבוא.
-- The parties, the terms the preamble coins ("המדינה", "הסתדרות המורים",
-- "הרפורמה", "ההסכם הזמני"), and the recitals. By §1 the preamble is an
-- integral part of the agreement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `פתיח`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 The title, and the signing line with its day and month left blank; no rule (the corpus dates the agreement 25.12.2008).

§§ `The parties`

-- p4-p8: the Government of Israel, for the State, represented by the
-- Treasury's wages commissioner and the Ministry's director-general, is
-- "המדינה"; p9-p11: the teachers' union, represented by its secretary
-- general, is "הסתדרות המורים". The two are the agreement's parties.
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11
`the parties to the agreement` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- The State acts through the two officers p5-p6 name.
`those who represent the State` MEANS LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the Ministry of Education`

§§ `The recitals`

-- p13 coins "הרפורמה": the cooperation in applying Ofek Hadash in the
-- institutions it lists, including their teachers' terms of work and pay.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
DECLARE `institution of the reform` IS ONE OF
    `a primary school`
    `a junior high school`
    `a kindergarten`
    `special education`
    `a regional support centre (מתי"א)`
    `a therapeutic centre`
    `a Pais cluster`
    `a teachers' centre (פסג"ה)`

`the institutions the reform names` MEANS
    LIST `a primary school`, `a junior high school`, `a kindergarten`, `special education`,
         `a regional support centre (מתי"א)`, `a therapeutic centre`, `a Pais cluster`, `a teachers' centre (פסג"ה)`

-- akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p19 Recitals: the Government's decision, the negotiations, the outline of principles of 16.5.07; no rule.

-- p18 coins "ההסכם הזמני": the interim collective agreement of 10.9.07,
-- under which the reform began on 1.9.07.
@ref akn:preamble/p18
`the interim agreement is dated` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 9 2007
`the reform began on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007

-- akn:preamble/p20 A recital: the interim agreement was extended on 31.8.08 and 3.11.08, and the pension agreement of 31.8.08 was signed; no rule.

-- p21: the parties agreed to negotiate a further agreement for the
-- populations it lists; this agreement does not cover them (§3 says whom
-- it covers).
@ref akn:preamble/p21
DECLARE `population left to a further agreement` IS ONE OF
    `teaching employees in instruction roles`
    `supervisors`
    `Shelach teachers`
    `teaching employees in colleges and seminars`
    `teaching employees on agricultural farms and marine centres`
    `kindergarten teachers outside the definition of "גננת"`
    `further populations of teaching employees in the civil service`

-- akn:preamble/p22 The operative formula ("לפיכך הוצהר, הותנה והוסכם"); no rule.

#ASSERT count `the parties to the agreement` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the reform began on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2007)
